    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Number of households (women) benefiting from the cash for nutrition program (all females)</narrative>
    </title>
    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">Eligible households (including Social Welfare Fund households - SWF) that have pregnant/lactating women and/or children under five as well as  mothers with children with disabilities up to the age of 17 years will receive nutrition-sensitive cash transfers for 6 months, whereas any cases identified with malnutrition will continue to receive benefits for 12 months.</narrative>
